y request the database sees costs the SAME whether it succeeds or fails -- so the design's entire job is losing the 499,000", "originalText": "Every request the database sees costs the SAME whether it succeeds or fails -- so the design's entire job is losing the 499,000", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#7ee787", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 62989}, {"id": "ev2", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 414, "width": 1620, "height": 20, "text": "failing requests as early and as cheaply as possible, not making the database fast enough to absorb all 500,000 of them.", "originalText": "failing requests as early and as cheaply as possible, not making the database fast enough to absorb all 500,000 of them.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#7ee787", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 73641}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}}